  "content": "# 第29题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\nWhat can be inferred from the last paragraph?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Climate change has been forgotten.\n\nB. B. Lessons of history are highly valued.\n\nC. C. The human mind is bad at noting slow change.\n\nD. D. Humans are unwilling to admit their shortcomings.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nC\n\n",
  "answer": "B",
  "analysis": "本题考查名词性从句。主语从句中缺主语，且指‘什么’，故用what。句意‘他说的话让我很惊讶’，选B。"
